  "description": "Repairs r-str-ado-act/ado-params: Refresh followed by two Appends double-counted the parameters, so a failure about \"?_1\" said nothing about named mapping. On a read-write ACE connection (own copy of r-fix-wire-ado-ado5), a Command with the text \"SELECT ID, Code FROM K WHERE Code = ? OR Code = ?\" and Refresh only, no Append: Parameters.Count before Refresh, Refresh, the inventory (Name, Type, Direction, Size, Precision, NumericScale, Value), Parameters(0).Value = \"a2\" and Parameters(1).Value = \"b3\" with each read back, Execute and all rows; Connection.Errors read and cleared right after Refresh and after Execute. Asks the discovered parameters and whether Execute binds them.",
